# Copy to .env.local (gitignored via the *.local pattern) and fill in to
# point this dashboard at a differently-hosted backend instead of using
# vite.config.ts's dev proxy to localhost:8000.
#
# Leave unset/commented for normal local dev - relative /api/v1 requests go
# through the Vite proxy to localhost:8000, same-origin, so cookies/CSRF
# work without any cross-site cookie configuration.
#
# Set to a full origin + /api/v1 to call a deployed backend directly, e.g.
# a free Render pilot instance (see backend/README.md "Deploying a pilot
# instance"). That backend must have COOKIE_SAMESITE=none and this
# dashboard's origin listed in CORS_ORIGINS, or authenticated requests will
# silently fail - see backend/.env.example's COOKIE_SAMESITE comment.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://employee-agent-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
